.pHive/*
# Legacy state/ — ignored completely. Harness sessions running the pre-rename
# Stop hook may briefly recreate state/interrupts/ files until the session
# restarts. Keeping state/ ignored prevents those files from polluting PRs.
state/
# meta-team state, team configs, and team-memories are plugin-level and should be tracked
!.pHive/meta-team/
!.pHive/meta-team/**
!.pHive/teams/
!.pHive/teams/**
!.pHive/team-memories/
!.pHive/team-memories/**
# Meta-improvement-system epic artifacts (planning + audit trail for maintainer tooling).
# The parent .pHive/epics/ and .pHive/episodes/ dirs must be un-ignored first —
# git will not recurse into an ignored directory even if a deeper negation exists.
!.pHive/epics/
!.pHive/episodes/
# Then re-ignore every child of those dirs except the meta-improvement-system subtree.
.pHive/epics/*
.pHive/episodes/*
!.pHive/epics/meta-improvement-system/
!.pHive/epics/meta-improvement-system/**
!.pHive/episodes/meta-improvement-system/
!.pHive/episodes/meta-improvement-system/**
# Hive composability audit + 2.0 milestone epics — planning + audit trail tracked
# at the maintainer level so the audit recommendation, follow-on epics, and
# cycle-state stay reviewable.
!.pHive/epics/hive-composability-audit/
!.pHive/epics/hive-composability-audit/**
!.pHive/epics/catalog-hygiene-and-borrows/
!.pHive/epics/catalog-hygiene-and-borrows/**
!.pHive/epics/structural-refactor-and-gate-lift/
!.pHive/epics/structural-refactor-and-gate-lift/**
!.pHive/epics/task-tracking-adapter-abi/
!.pHive/epics/task-tracking-adapter-abi/**
!.pHive/epics/ui-cluster-extract-config-deeper/
!.pHive/epics/ui-cluster-extract-config-deeper/**
!.pHive/epics/sandcastle-adoption-followon/
!.pHive/epics/sandcastle-adoption-followon/**
!.pHive/episodes/sandcastle-adoption-followon/
!.pHive/episodes/sandcastle-adoption-followon/**
!.pHive/epics/kg-signal-revival/
!.pHive/epics/kg-signal-revival/**
!.pHive/epics/sandcastle-ops-layer/
!.pHive/epics/sandcastle-ops-layer/**
!.pHive/epics/meta-hive-grooming-may2026/
!.pHive/epics/meta-hive-grooming-may2026/**
!.pHive/epics/ui-logo-imagegen-integration/
!.pHive/epics/ui-logo-imagegen-integration/**
!.pHive/epics/claude-in-sandcastle-switch/
!.pHive/epics/claude-in-sandcastle-switch/**
# Per-epic cycle-state lives under .pHive/cycle-state/; only the
# meta-improvement-system entry is tracked at this time (same maintainer-
# infrastructure rationale as the epics/ and episodes/ subtrees above).
!.pHive/cycle-state/
.pHive/cycle-state/*
!.pHive/cycle-state/meta-improvement-system.yaml
!.pHive/cycle-state/ui-cluster-extract-config-deeper.yaml
!.pHive/cycle-state/sandcastle-adoption-followon.yaml
!.pHive/cycle-state/kg-signal-revival.yaml
# Specialist-phase audit trail for the Sandcastle adoption work (security plan-audit
# verdict + re-audit, performance post-run audit). Tracked as decision provenance for
# the major-severity pre-exec gate resolution + minor post-run informational audit.
!.pHive/specialist-phases/
.pHive/specialist-phases/*
!.pHive/specialist-phases/security:plan-audit/
!.pHive/specialist-phases/security:plan-audit/sandcastle-adoption-followon/
!.pHive/specialist-phases/security:plan-audit/sandcastle-adoption-followon/**
!.pHive/specialist-phases/security:plan-audit/kg-signal-revival/
!.pHive/specialist-phases/security:plan-audit/kg-signal-revival/**
!.pHive/specialist-phases/performance:audit/
!.pHive/specialist-phases/performance:audit/sandcastle-adoption-followon/
!.pHive/specialist-phases/performance:audit/sandcastle-adoption-followon/**
!.pHive/specialist-phases/performance:audit/kg-signal-revival/
!.pHive/specialist-phases/performance:audit/kg-signal-revival/**
# Metrics carrier (.pHive/metrics/) — authored by S2 stories of the
# meta-improvement-system epic; contains schema docs and, from C1.4 on,
# fixtures consumed by hive/lib/metrics/ unit tests.
!.pHive/metrics/
!.pHive/metrics/**
# MVL proof artifacts — only the canonical mvl-proof folder ships with the repo.
!.pHive/audits/
.pHive/audits/*
!.pHive/audits/mvl-proof/
!.pHive/audits/mvl-proof/**
!.pHive/audits/mvs-proof/
!.pHive/audits/mvs-proof/**
# Consumer-side executor flag (hde-9a Q4 lock). Tracked because the maintainer
# repo doubles as the canonical consumer for plugin-hive itself; consumers of
# the plugin choose whether to commit their own .pHive/hive.config.yaml.
!.pHive/hive.config.yaml
# Consumer-side per-workflow graduation registry (hde-9b). Same maintainer-
# as-canonical-consumer rationale as the flag above; other content under
# .pHive/runtime/ stays ignored.
!.pHive/runtime/
.pHive/runtime/*
!.pHive/runtime/executor-graduated-workflows.yaml
agents/memories/
.claude/settings.local.json
.history/
.DS_Store
*.log
.claude/*.lock
.sandcastle/
# Python bytecode/caches — C1.4 (hive/lib/metrics/) introduced Python 3 runtime
# primitives with stdlib-only deps. Prevent __pycache__/ and *.pyc files from
# polluting the tree as future maintainer tooling adds more Python.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Single-file domain glossary (story a-26-context-md-schema-and-starter).
# This file IS tracked — it serves as plugin-hive own CONTEXT.md and as
# an exemplar for downstream projects.
!.pHive/CONTEXT.md
# upstream-watch: durable upstream blocker records tracked at maintainer level.
!.pHive/upstream-watch/
!.pHive/upstream-watch/**
# Logo exploration artifacts (story ulo-4-artifact-conventions).
# Track the logo-explorations dir structure so prompts.md / contact-sheet.html
# / selected.yaml stay reviewable in git; ignore the PNG candidates (large
# binaries, regeneratable from prompts.md).
!.pHive/brand/
.pHive/brand/*
!.pHive/brand/logo-explorations/
!.pHive/brand/logo-explorations/**
.pHive/brand/logo-explorations/**/*.png

# Local dev — better-sqlite3 transient install for kg bootstrap (BYO enhancement)
node_modules/
